  id: sir_neville_marriner
  category: bandas musicales
  difficulty: 1
  answer: Sir Neville Marriner
  acceptedAnswers:
  - Sir Neville Marriner
  hints:
  - "Su cat\xE1logo registrado incluye \xABII. Largo from Concerto for Harpsichord,
    Strings & Basso continuo No. 5 in F minor, BWV 1056\xBB, de 1959, y llega hasta
    2007."
  - "\xABSerenade in D, K.250 \"Haffner\": 4. Rondo (Allegro)\xBB presenta una energ\xEDa
    suave y un pulso cercano a 99 BPM."
  - "Entre sus grabaciones figuran \xABIl barbiere di Siviglia: Overture (Sinfonia)\xBB
    y \xABSolomon HWV 67 / Act 3: The Arrival Of The Queen Of Sheba\xBB."
  - "Tambi\xE9n lanz\xF3 \xABPachelbel: Canon and Gigue in D Major, P. 37: I. Canon\xBB."
  - "Es el proyecto musical detr\xE1s de \xABSymphony No.25 in G minor, K.183: 1.
    Allegro con brio\xBB y \xABPeer Gynt Suite No. 2, Op. 55: IV. Solveig's Song\xBB."
